# The dashboard runs in demo mode out of the box — no config needed to see it live.
#
# Wallet connection (MetaMask) works without any env vars.
#
# (Optional) If you later wire the dashboard to real deployed contracts, add:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTSETTLE_FACTORY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTSETTLE_SETTLEMENT=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTSETTLE_REGISTRY=
